3	/** 할인액 계산(R2.4). 모든 피연산자가 비음수이므로 정수 나눗셈이 곧 floor. */
4	public final class CouponPolicy {
5	
6	    private CouponPolicy() {
7	    }
8	
9	    public static long discount(Coupon coupon, long subtotal) {
10	        long raw = coupon.getType() == CouponType.FIXED
11	                ? coupon.getValue()
12	                : Math.multiplyExact(subtotal, coupon.getValue()) / 100;
13	        long d = coupon.getMaxDiscountAmount() == null ? raw : Math.min(raw, coupon.getMaxDiscountAmount());
14	        return Math.min(d, subtotal);
15	    }
16	}
